Repay_Concrete_Test
├── given the contract is halted
│   └── it should revert
└── given the contract is not halted
    ├── when maxCount is zero or above 50
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when maxCount is 1 to 50
        ├── given the queue is empty
        │   └── it should change nothing
        └── given someone is owed
            ├── given there is no free money
            │   └── it should change nothing
            └── given there is free money
                ├── when a payout has too little gas
                │   └── it should revert
                └── when every payout has the gas it needs
                    ├── given the token refuses a payout
                    │   ├── it should keep it for the owner to claim
                    │   └── it should go on down the queue
                    ├── given free money covers only part of the head
                    │   ├── it should pay the head all the free money, less the winner fee
                    │   ├── it should keep the rest owed at the head
                    │   └── it should stop there
                    └── given free money covers the head
                        ├── it should close the head and move on to the next IOU
                        ├── it should repay in queue order, at most maxCount
                        ├── it should accrue the winner fees once
                        ├── it should emit {OwedRepaid} for each repayment
                        └── it should return the number repaid
